DESCRIPTION:The Gravel Roll is BACK! Hollerin' for more in Walhalla in 202
 6! Guaranteed to make you whoop\, The Holler in Walhalla is our mountain g
 ravel race for the Gravel Roll in 2025. If you've ridden the Valley of the
  Giants in the past\, the road surface composition will be very similar an
 d is representative of what mountain gravel with the U.S. Forest Service r
 oad system is like. There'll be some smooth crush\, some chunky\, and of c
 ourse a dash of our usual Gravel Roll fun. Like for you Bosses out there\,
  we've got a little “bonus” for y'all. Like most of our mountain grave
 l rides\, this one doesn't meet our usual 70% threshold for paved to unpav
 ed\, but we think you'll welcome the smooth but swoopy tarmac when you enc
 ounter it\, and rip it all the same. Afterwards\, hang around at the Walha
 lla Depot f\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/the-holler\n\nSource: BikeReg\
 n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:34.762378;-83.0661084
LOCATION:211 S College St\, Walhalla\, SC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/the-holler
END:VEVENT
