BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Long Distance Training Presented by ASICS
DTSTART:20260824T000000
DTEND:20261114T000000
DTSTAMP:20260817T172753Z
UID:94ddab525c843bc9@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Go the distance with Fleet Feet Knoxville and ASICS! This Fall
 \, we have a 12-week training program to get you ready for the iconic Loop
  Lope 10 Miler in the Great Smoky Mountain National Park on Sunday\, Novem
 ber 8th! Challenge yourself along the way and join the Veterans Salute 5k 
 and 10k on November 7th and the Secret City Half Marathon on November 14th
 - your goal race options are many and we are here to help you achieve all 
 your goals. Please note that there are 30 guaranteed spots into Loop Lope.
  These will be secured by registration order - first come\, first serve. Y
 ou do not have to participate in the goal races to join the program. Train
 ing program fee does not include goal race entry fees. Training for a big 
 race takes more than logging miles. It takes a smart plan\, the right supp
 or\n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Knoxville/FallLongDistanceTraini
 ng\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:11619 Parkside Dr\, Knoxville\, TN
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Knoxville/FallLongDistanceTraining
END:VEVENT
