DTSTART:20260910T000000
DTEND:20260912T000000
DTSTAMP:20260817T172753Z
UID:104702416f26c92b@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Thank YOU 2025 Runners! Hope to see you in 2026... as we begin
  the 3rd decade of running the breathtaking Blue Ridge Mountains! Septembe
 r 11-12\, 2026 (Fri. - Sat.) The Blue Ridge Relay ( BRR )\, which is one o
 f the longest running relay races in the United States\, takes place in th
 e picturesque Blue Ridge Mountains of Virginia and North Carolina. BRR con
 sists of maximum 12 person (4 person minimum) teams that rotate through 36
  transition areas as they cover the approximate 208 mile distance of the r
 ace. The Start! BRR starts in Grayson Highlands State Pa rk \, VA a t an e
 levation of 4920′\, near the base of Mount Rogers (5729′)\, the highes
 t peak in Virginia. The Highlands’ defining feature are the high elevati
 on balds that are spotted with stands of native Fraser Fir\, boulder field
 s and a her\n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/NC/Asheville/blueridgerela
 y\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:Blue Ridge Mountains...VA - NC\, USA\, Asheville\, NC
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/NC/Asheville/blueridgerelay
END:VEVENT
