 ent is for you! Women+ and Girls Take Over Rock Creek! No matter your skil
 l level\, showing up and riding any mountain bike park can be a little int
 imidating\, especially if you don't have a friend to ride with. That’s w
 hy we’re extending an invite out to women+ of all ages to join us at Roc
 k Creek – without racing or egos – to have fun on the trails and progr
 ess at your own pace. Join pro downhill racer/ MTB skills coach/ mom Carol
