UID:0cf4220b71877604@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Come showcase your ability at the TALI Croft State Park Off-Ro
 ad Duathlon. The Adult race takes you on a 3.5-mile trail run where you wi
 ll be running where horses still roam\, watch out for those horse pies 
 😊. Then its off to the mountain bike trail course with plenty of climbi
 ng\, drops and water crossings to make you feel as if you are riding on a 
 bronco. Once on the trail you will do two loops equally 10 miles for total
  distance of ~11 miles. Finish with a 1.5 mile out and back dash through a
  wooded area along the trails of Croft. The Youth race will begin on the 1
 -mile nature trail flowing through mixed pine and hardwood trees and wind 
 along the Fairforest creek. Then its off to the mountain bike trail course
  with plenty of climbing and drops to make you feel as if you are riding o
 n a br\n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/SC/Spartanburg/CroftStateParkOf
 fRoadDuathlon\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bik
 e/calendar
