DTEND:20270306T000000
DTSTAMP:20260817T172753Z
UID:7c8362898e390129@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:🏞️ Welcome to the Mountain’s Challenge So\, you wish to
  walk among the clouds? ☁️ Then lace up\, for this journey takes you o
 ver the mighty backs of Pinnacle Mountain and the legendary Table Rock\, t
 wo of South Carolina’s tallest guardians of stone. 🗻 These trails? Th
 ey ain't gentle. They're steep\, rocky\, and relentless—but also stunnin
 gly beautiful. 🌄 Every switchback\, every climb\, every gasping moment 
 rewards you with panoramic views most only dream of. And when your legs tr
 emble at the summit\, the mountains whisper: You are strong. You are worth
 y. 🥾 Why You’ll Love (and Respect) This Race 🐻 Bear Crawl 25k – 
 One brutal loop 🐐 Foothills 50k – Two soul-shaping laps 🪨 16\,000 
 feet of elevation change 🏔️ Summits of Pinnacle & Table Rock 🌲 A t
 ight-knit tribe of trail runners to share the journey \n\nMore: https://ru
 nsignup.com/Race/SC/Pickens/ConquertheRock\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed 
 by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:W. Gate Road\, Pickens\, SC
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/SC/Pickens/ConquertheRock
END:VEVENT
