 ome you to the heart of the North Georgia mountains for the 2nd Annual Hia
 wassee Half Marathon & 5K! Starting and finishing in the charming Hiawasse
 e Town Square\, this scenic road race showcases the beauty of our mountain
 -lake community. Both courses feature stunning views of Lake Chatuge\, wit
 h the half marathon offering a full 360-degree tour around its sparkling s
 horeline. With moderately hilly terrain and well-maintained road surfaces\
 , runners of all experience levels can enjoy a smooth\, fast course surrou
 nded by breathtaking scenery. Half Marathon: 7:30 am Start\; 4 hour time l
 imit (18 min 20 sec mile) 5K: 8:30 am Start Pricing 5K - Registration $35 
 ($45 after January 31\, 2027) Half Marathon - Registration $85 ($95 after 
