DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the fine tunes of local musicians as you run or walk on 
 our beautiful 5k route in Mars Hill\, North Carolina. Just north of Ashevi
 lle\, the Fiddlin' 5k is a local favorite and it's easy to understand why.
  The course starts and finishes on the beautiful Otis Duck Greenway where 
 participants will be treated to wholesome snacks and spectacular mountain 
 and rural views. Also\, please add us to your e-mail contact list so our i
 mportant e-mails won't end up in your spam folder! Fiddlin5Krun@gmail.com 
 *** Sign up by April 15 to guarantee your T-shirt ***\n\nMore: https://run
 signup.com/Race/NC/MarsHill/Fiddlin5k\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Al
 tar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
