UID:a0891c679c35eeb3@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Experience one of the fastest and most scenic half marathons i
 n East Tennessee. The Little River Rush Half Marathon offers a unique poin
 t-to-point course through the peaceful back roads of Townsend\, surrounded
  by breathtaking mountain views and free from the congestion of busier rac
 e locations. Starting at the Smoky Mountain Heritage Center\, the course t
 ravels one direction to Heritage High School\, showcasing over 600 feet of
  total descent and more than 200 feet of net downhill\, making this a trul
 y fast and rewarding race experience\, It's really downhill\, like actuall
 y\, check the course profile down below! This course is USATF Certified fo
 r Age Group\, National records or for using to get into other races requir
 ing a time standard: Race Details Runner Check-In & Packet Pickup: All par
 ticipa\n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Maryville/TownsendDownsHalfM
 arathon\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/cale
 ndar
