UID:2e7ffffc4cf1d120@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Beer City USA with your running buddies! Discov
 er Asheville\, North Carolina\, nestled in the picturesque Blue Ridge Moun
 tains\, where clean mountain water flows and a rich beer brewing legacy th
 rives. Experience a beer lover’s paradise with over 30 craft breweries\,
  making it home to some of the finest breweries in the nation. Embraced by
  enthusiasts\, Asheville tops many must-visit lists for its exceptional br
 ews and captivating mountain charm\, attracting runners\, bikers\, and hik
 ers alike. Don’t miss the highly anticipated Beer City Relay\, where the
  spirit of running and craft beer converge. The esteemed host for this yea
 r’s event is none other than New Belgium Brewing. Originating in Fort Co
 llins CO\, New Belgium brought their east coast hub to Asheville in 2016. 
 We are proud t\n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/NC/Asheville/BeerCityRa
 cesNC\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calend
 ar
