DTSTART:20270605T000000
DTEND:20270605T000000
DTSTAMP:20260817T172753Z
UID:2c15bbb08522e30f@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The Smoky Mountain Wheelmen proudly present the 24th Edition o
 f the Cherohala Challenge. The event offers three distinctive rides that a
 lmost anyone can find a ride that will fit their skill level with rides of
  35\, 62\, and 115 miles. Join us Saturday\, June 6\, for breathtaking vie
 ws and pride inducing climbs on one of three world class routes. The 2026 
 edition moves the start/finish to Vonore to enhance\, safety\, new routes\
 , and a new overall experience! The title event\, the Cherohala Challenge 
 Century\, is not for the faint of heart. This once in a lifetime ride test
 s riders with 115 miles and 10\,350ft of climbing across two states. Rider
 s begin in Vonore heading climb to Deals Gap and brave the fabled 318 curv
 es of the Tail of the Dragon. After besting the beast\, riders will descen
 d the mou\n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Vonore/CherohalaChallenge
 \n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:414 Hall St\, Vonore\, TN
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Vonore/CherohalaChallenge
END:VEVENT
